{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Apple 上調 iPhone 18 Pro 及 iPhone 18 Pro Max 的電池更換費用，兩款新機的收費較 iPhone 16 Pro 與 iPhone 17 Pro 增加 HK$71/NT$340，最新價格為 HK$999/NT$4,150。</p>\n\n<h2>前代收費水平</h2>\n<p>iPhone 16 Pro 及 iPhone 17 Pro 的電池更換費用一向為 119 美元，iPhone 18 Pro 及 iPhone 18 Pro Max 的電池容量較大，是收費上調的原因。</p>\n<img alt=\"iphone16 repair price hk\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/iphone16-repair-price-hk.webp\"/>\n<img alt=\"iphone16 repair price tw\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/iphone16-repair-price-tw.webp\"/>\n<h2>保養期內免費更換電池</h2>\n<p>不過，若 iPhone 已購買 AppleCare+ 保障，當電池容量跌至 80% 以下，Apple 會免費更換電池，不另收費。</p>\n<img alt=\"iphone18 repair price hk\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/iphone18-repair-price-hk.webp\"/>\n<img alt=\"iphone18 repair price tw\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/iphone18-repair-price-tw.webp\"/>\n<h2>設定內查看電池健康度</h2>\n<p>用戶可在「設定」應用程式中進入「電池」，再查看「電池健康度」，確認電池容量是否已跌至 80% 以下。</p>\n<img alt=\"與 iPhone 18 Pro 相關的圖片\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/iphone18pro-1.webp\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-17T19:59:20.578803+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":373,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}